==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-весь.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-весь.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|orv|вьсь|id=entire}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*vьśь}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*wišas}}. Cognate with {{cog|sa|विश्व||all}}.

====Determiner====
{{etymid|ru|determiner}}
{{head|ru|determiner|g=m|feminine|вся|neuter|всё|plural|все}}

# {{sid|ru|singular determiner}} {{lb|ru|in the singular}} [[all]], the [[whole]], [[all]] of, the [[whole]] of, the [[entire]], the [[entirety]] of
#: {{syn|ru|це́лый}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''весь''' [[день]]|'''all''' day (long)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''весь''' [[мир]]|'''the whole''' world}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вся''' [[Москва́]]|'''all of''' Moscow}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''всё''' [[предложе́ние]]|'''the whole''' sentence}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[по]] '''всему́''' [[ми́ру]] / [[во]] '''всём''' [[ми́ре]]|t=(all) around/across the world; all over the world|lit=across '''the whole''' world / in '''the whole''' world}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[съе́ли]] '''всю''' [[еду́]].|They ate '''all''' the food.}}
# {{sid|ru|plural determiner}} {{lb|ru|in the plural}} [[all]], [[all]] (of) (''about discrete entities'')
#: {{syn|ru|'''все''' [[из]]|вся́кий|ка́ждый}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''все''' [[шко́лы]] [[в]] [[Росси́и]]|'''all''' schools in Russia}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''все''' [[ингредие́нты]]|'''all (of)''' the ingredients}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мы|Мы]] [[обошли́]] '''все''' [[магази́ны]].|We went to '''all''' the shops.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} {{n-g|Used to emphasise the size of a numerical figure, especially in estimates;}} [[no]] [[less]] [[than]], [[no]] [[fewer]] [[than]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на|На]] [[вид]] [[ей]] [[мо́жно]] [[дать]] '''все''' [[со́рок]] ([[лет]]).|From her appearance, you could give her '''no fewer than''' forty years.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[до|До]] [[ближа́йшей]] [[дере́вни]] [[бы́ло]] '''все''' [[три́дцать]] [[киломе́тров]].|It was '''a whole''' thirty kilometres to the nearest village.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[отсюда|Отсю́да]] [[до]] [[го́рода]] [[киломе́тров]] [[три́дцать пять]], [[а то]] [[и]] '''все''' [[со́рок]].|From here to the city is thirty five kilometres, if not forty.}}

