====Pronoun====
{{etymid|ru|pronoun}}
{{head|ru|pronoun|g=m|feminine|вся|neuter|всё|plural|все}}

# {{sid|ru|singular pronoun}} {{lb|ru|in the singular}} [[all]] (of it), the [[whole]] (of it), the [[entirety]] (of it), (it) [[all]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[рэп|Рэп]] [[мне]] [[нра́вится]], [[но]] [[не]] '''весь'''.|I like rap, but not '''all of it'''.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[эта|Э́та]] [[рабо́та]] [[ска́зывается]] [[на]] [[мое́й]] [[жи́зни]], [[да́же]] [[не]] [[на]] [[ча́сти]], [[а]] [[на]] '''всей'''.|This work affects my life, not even a part of it, but '''all of it'''.}}
# {{sid|ru|plural pronoun}} {{lb|ru|in the plural}} [[all]] (of them), [[every]] [[one]] (of them), (them) [[all]]
#: {{syn|ru|ка́ждый}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мне|Мне]] [[нра́вятся]] [[не́которые]], [[но]] [[не]] '''все'''.|I like some, but not '''all'''.}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ru|все|t=everyone|g=an-p|id=everyone}}
* {{l|ru|всё|t=everything|g=in-s|id=everything}}

====Adverb====
{{etymid|ru|adverb}}
{{head|ru|adverb|g=m|feminine|вся|neuter|всё|plural|все}}

# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} [[all]] {{gl|completely}} {{+obj|ru|adjective/:в(pre)}}
#: {{syn|ru|по́лностью|соверше́нно|целико́м}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] '''весь''' [[мо́крый]].|He's '''all''' wet.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] '''вся''' [[в]] [[ожида́нии]] [[ле́та]].|I'm '''all''' excited for summer.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} [[covered]] {{+obj|ru|:в(pre)<in something>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[она|Она́]] '''вся''' [[в]] [[синяка́х]].|She's '''covered''' in bruises.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} [[just]] [[like]], [[takes after]] {{q|used to express a similarity in personality}} {{+obj|ru|:в(acc)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[она|Он]] '''весь''' [[в]] [[отца́]].|He's '''just like''' his father. / He '''takes after''' his father.}}

